{
    "title": "\u6f2b\u5ba2\u68e7-\u4e8c\u6b21\u5143\u8d85\u5feb\u770b\u6f2b\u756b",
    "description": "Massive content, daily high-definition updates, say goodbye to the book shortage!\r\n\r\nLots of full colors, easy to use, great experience!\r\n\r\n\u3010Chinese comic classic\u3011\r\n\r\n\"Fight to Break the Sphere\", \"The Wind Rises in the Canglan\", \"The Demon God\", \"The Phoenix Against the World\", \"The Divine Seal Throne\"...\r\n\r\n\u3010Popular Popularity\u3011\r\n\r\n\"Star Martial God Technique\", \"Heaven-Defying Evil God\", \"Shenwu Tianzun\", \"Famous Sword Tomb\", \"Become the King's Daughter Someday\"...\r\n\r\nPassionate fantasy - wonderful story, ups and downs\r\n\r\n\"The Book of Demons and Gods\": Because of a book of time and space demon spirits, time and space are reversed. When everything starts again, the wheel of fate turns slowly.\r\n\r\n\"Yuan Zun\": There is a prophecy that the meridians are blocked and cannot be practiced. Bearing the hatred of the country and the family, he relied on his strong will to reopen his eight veins, and rose up strongly at a time when his family was in danger.\r\n\r\n\"Star Martial God Technique\": The world-shaking path of a powerful man who can defy the heavens, with a beauty by his side, cultivate the Star Martial inheritance, hold power in all directions, and become the Supreme God King!\r\n\r\n\"A Hundred Refinements to Become a God\": Adapted from the novel of the same name, the fantasy journey of young Luo Zheng being beaten into a god!\r\n\r\n\"Solo and Happy\": I am greedy for the mortal world and only want the prosperity of the world and the well-being of you and me. If the world is unkind, one can only raise the sword in anger and cut out a vast universe.\r\n\r\nAncient style of love - not just pure love\r\n\r\n\"The Emperor's Only Daughter\": After being reborn in another world, I became the only princess of the Ogli Empire.\r\n\r\n\"I was hacked by the president!\" \u300b: A popular idol turns into a fat woman? ! Then he accidentally entered the head office of the black fan? ! In order to pay off the debt, you have to play the role of the other party's nanny and part-time intimate sister? !\r\n\r\n\"Journey to Search for Past Lives\": The cause of the past life is the result of the future life. If you sow this cause, then no matter how many reincarnations you go through, you will not be able to get rid of this result.\r\n\r\n\"Go back to ancient times and become a national treasure\": I didn't expect that with a casual sigh, I actually turned into a panda and traveled back to ancient times. However, the panda was not a national treasure in those days!\r\n\r\n\"The Daughter of the Miracle Doctor\": Two miracle doctors traveled through the Great Shun Dynasty. What is going on with the betrothal god? The cripple with a disfigured face is so ugly that I still want to help him win the world?\r\n\r\n\r\n[Multiple comic categories]\r\n\r\nPassionate, funny, cultivation, adventure, love, romance, fantasy, action, suspense, science fiction, campus, wealthy family, boss, time travel, ancient style, fantasy, war, competition, real person... everything is available.\r\n\r\n\u3010Many benefits\u3011\r\n\r\nWeekly welfare experience, reading and chasing books more smoothly!\r\n\r\nEasily earn points through daily tasks, and receive popular game skins and other gifts without stopping!\r\n\r\n\u3010Super complete comic novel\u3011\r\n\r\nGenuine high-quality graphic novels with rich themes, everything you want is here, so you can bid farewell to the book shortage!",
    "descriptionHTML": "Massive content, daily high-definition updates, say goodbye to the book shortage!<br><br>Lots of full colors, easy to use, great experience!<br><br>\u3010Chinese comic classic\u3011<br><br>&quot;Fight to Break the Sphere&quot;, &quot;The Wind Rises in the Canglan&quot;, &quot;The Demon God&quot;, &quot;The Phoenix Against the World&quot;, &quot;The Divine Seal Throne&quot;...<br><br>\u3010Popular Popularity\u3011<br><br>&quot;Star Martial God Technique&quot;, &quot;Heaven-Defying Evil God&quot;, &quot;Shenwu Tianzun&quot;, &quot;Famous Sword Tomb&quot;, &quot;Become the King&#39;s Daughter Someday&quot;...<br><br>Passionate fantasy - wonderful story, ups and downs<br><br>&quot;The Book of Demons and Gods&quot;: Because of a book of time and space demon spirits, time and space are reversed. When everything starts again, the wheel of fate turns slowly.<br><br>&quot;Yuan Zun&quot;: There is a prophecy that the meridians are blocked and cannot be practiced. Bearing the hatred of the country and the family, he relied on his strong will to reopen his eight veins, and rose up strongly at a time when his family was in danger.<br><br>&quot;Star Martial God Technique&quot;: The world-shaking path of a powerful man who can defy the heavens, with a beauty by his side, cultivate the Star Martial inheritance, hold power in all directions, and become the Supreme God King!<br><br>&quot;A Hundred Refinements to Become a God&quot;: Adapted from the novel of the same name, the fantasy journey of young Luo Zheng being beaten into a god!<br><br>&quot;Solo and Happy&quot;: I am greedy for the mortal world and only want the prosperity of the world and the well-being of you and me. If the world is unkind, one can only raise the sword in anger and cut out a vast universe.<br><br>Ancient style of love - not just pure love<br><br>&quot;The Emperor&#39;s Only Daughter&quot;: After being reborn in another world, I became the only princess of the Ogli Empire.<br><br>&quot